    not_duplicate_of: []  # b79f
    pr_ref:  # b79f
    description: "Go analyzer only detects implements from explicit var _ Interface = &Struct{} assertions. Most Go code uses structural typing without assertions. In prometheus, only 2 of 18 Queryable implementors have implements edges. Need structural matching: collect interface method sets, then match structs whose method sets are supersets. This would dramatically improve interface ranking (Queryable, Storage, Querier are central abstractions but rank poorly due to missing implements edges)."  # b79f
    fields: {}  # b79f
